e":"caption","file":"s23.png","x":0,"y":7645.4189453125,"w":1440,"h":17.4560546875},{"z":25,"kind":"video","name":"video","file":"v12-2518.mp4","poster":"p12-2518.png","x":185,"y":7742.875,"w":1070,"h":536,"radius":8},{"z":26,"kind":"image","name":"caption","file":"s26.png","x":0,"y":8298.4189453125,"w":1440,"h":17.4560546875},{"z":27,"kind":"image","name":"col","file":"s27.png","x":0,"y":8395.875,"w":1440,"h":153},{"z":28,"kind":"image","name":"Frame 261","file":"s28.png","x":88.5,"y":8590.875,"w":1287,"h":1662},{"z":29,"kind":"image","name":"Frame 316","file":"s29.png","x":0,"y":10290.875,"w":1440,"h":17},{"z":30,"kind":"box","x":0,"y":10387.875,"w":1440,"h":11870.84375,"fill":"#ffffff"},{"z":31,"kind":"image","name":"Colors & Typography","file":"s31.png","x":20,"y":10407.875,"w":1400,"h":1446},{"z":32,"kind":"image","name":"Persona","file":"s32.png","x":20,"y":11873.875,"w":1400,"h":1199},{"z":33,"kind":"image","name":"Information Architecture","file":"s33.png","x":20,"y":13092.875,"w":1400,"h":4402},{"z":34,"kind":"image","name":"User Flow","file":"s34.png","x":20,"y":17514.875,"w":1400,"h":2354},{"z":35,"kind":"image","name":"Comparison","file":"s35.png","x":20,"y":19888.875,"w":1400,"h":968},{"z":36,"kind":"image","name":"Wireframe","file":"s36.png","x":20,"y":20876.875,"w":1400,"h":1361.84375},{"z":40,"kind":"html","ia":"at","dw":984,"name":"Information Architecture (text)","x":228,"y":13251.875,"w":984,"h":4096,"fill":"#F4F3F1"},{"z":32.5,"kind":"box","name":"IA card background","x":20,"y":13092.875,"w":1400,"h":4402,"fill":"#F4F3F1","radius":20},{"z":33.5,"kind":"box","name":"User Flow card background","x":20,"y":17514.875,"w":1400,"h":2354,"fill":"#F4F3F1","radius":20},{"z":41,"kind":"html","ia":"flow","dw":862,"name":"User Flow (vector)","x":279,"y":17673.875,"w":883,"h":2048,"fill":"#F4F3F1"},{"id":"3:652","x":186,"y":1165,"w":570,"h":234,"fill":"#ffffff","html":"<p>Amazing Talker 是一個連結學生與教師的線上語言學習平台，本專案為 Amazing Talker 網頁的設計迭代 Case Study。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>根據本人、親友透過 Amazing Talker 學習語言的過程，發現一些介面使用的不便之處，與我的姊姊和 Amazing Talker 教師討論後，決定為平台設計一款讓學員及教師都可以更直覺找到需求入口、使學習更輕鬆愉快的線上學習平台。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>以 Design Thinking 流程進行：</p><p>從現況痛點盤點、競品分析、設計參考歸納、完整的 UI Redesign。</p>","z":200,"kind":"text","name":"text fix 3:652"},{"id":"1:329","x":186,"y":1993,"w":555,"h":342,"fill":"#ffffff","html":"<p class=\"h\">Landing Page 完整呈現平台服務及特色 → 提升顧客轉化率</p><ul><li>商業痛點：首頁不易辨識、使用者需花較多時間理解品牌服務與優勢</li><li>商業指標：未登入即可瀏覽教師介紹影片與課程資訊，降低進入門檻並提升註冊率與試聽課預約轉化</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"h\">導覽列功能重新分類、角色分流 → 降低使用阻力、減少誤觸與迷航</p><ul><li>商業痛點：教師與學生使用同一介面容易誤觸，需求功能增加時間成本</li><li>商業指標：讓不同角色的使用者明確找到需求入口，縮短完成預約的操作時間、提升預約完成率</li></ul><p class=\"h16\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"h\">統整 Design System → 縮短設計到開發的交付時間，提升品牌與開發效率</p><ul><li>商業痛點：Banner、卡片及設計元件久未更新，介面視覺精緻度不足</li><li>商業指標：確保跨頁面視覺一致，強化品牌信任感</li></ul>","z":201,"kind":"text","name":"text fix 1:329"},{"id":"1:372","x":753,"y":6302.875,"w":520,"h":26,"fill":"#deded9","html":"<p class=\"b\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\">為 Amazing Talker redesign 教師介紹頁面、常用功能等卡片介面重新設計</p>","z":202,"kind":"text","name":"text fix 1:372"}],"collapse":[{"top":13251.875,"full":4096,"short":698,"button":{"x":20,"y":17387.875,"w":1400,"h":27},"images":[{"z":33,"visibleTo":13251.875}]},{"top":17673.875,"full":2048,"short":705,"button":{"x":20,"y":19761.875,"w":1400,"h":27},"images":[{"z":34,"visibleTo":19721.875}]}]}